      "writtenOn": "2021-08-09T17:58:19Z",
      "side": 1,
      "message": "I move all .rodata.* from FIPS module into .rodata.fips section to have it combined and at fixed offsets. Except for special sections used by EC OS which are like \u0027interfaces\u0027 to FIPS module - what to call. in core/ec.ld.S .rodata.extensioncmds is handled so that it\u0027s start and end offsets are marked with symbols. Unlike other sections it doesn\u0027t use wildcards for input sections, so I have to name section properly. And I can\u0027t just do nothing as otherwise it will be combined with .rodata and won\u0027t be used to find extension commands.",
